"900.5.10(88)":{"explanation":"Exception RT 88 sets site-specific rules for these RT lands: minimum lot frontage and area as they existed when By-law 569-2013 was enacted, one dwelling unit per lot, a 3.0 m front setback, a 6.0 m setback for the main wall part giving access to the required parking space, parking inside the residential building, 40% maximum lot coverage, and compliance with exception 900.5.10(352).","code_refs":"none"},
"900.5.10(98)":{"explanation":"Exception RT 98 sets site-specific rules for these RT lands: one dwelling unit per lot, minimum lot frontage and area as they existed when By-law 569-2013 was enacted, a 1.5 m side setback (4.5 m on a street-abutting side of a corner lot), 50% maximum lot coverage, and the required parking space inside the residential building.","code_refs":"none"}
}}
